  "description": "The Vaporesso Luxe X3 sets a new benchmark for versatile pod vaping, combining industry-leading battery life with a truly adaptable platform. Built to seamlessly bridge the gap between vaping styles, the Luxe X3 is capable of delivering a satisfying Mouth-to-Lung (MTL), Restricted Direct-Lung (RDL), or even Direct-to-Lung (DTL) experience, making it one of the most flexible kits on the market today. Powering this versatility is a massive 2600mAh high-density battery, offering up to 96 hours of use between charges, and a smart 45W chipset that automatically detects your pod resistance. The device offers Vaporesso's \"Dual Mesh\" Corex technology in the included 0.4ohm and 0.6ohm pods, which utilises a twin-layer heating element to boost flavour accuracy and extend pod lifespan by up to 50%. Crucially, the Luxe X3 offers an open ecosystem for every vaper. While the included pods are optimised for RDL and DTL, the device remains fully compatible with the wider Luxe X series, including 0.8ohm pods for a tighter MTL draw. It also supports Luxe XR Empty Pods, unlocking compatibility with the entire GTX coil platform. With a crisp 0.8\" digital display, precision airflow slider, and physical locking key, the Luxe X3 adapts to your needs, not the other way around. Explore our vape liquids online selection and choose the flavour that best suits this kit. We Recommend paring the 0.6ohm Pod (pre-installed) with the Double Drip liquid that has been selected. Then pair the 0.4ohm Pod with High VG (Sub-Ohm) E-Liquid Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
